

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. DEMONSTRATION OVERVIEW

The project demonstration shows how LegalEase collects user details, generates legal document content using AI and provides the final document in different formats.

2. DEMONSTRATION PROCESS

• Open the LegalEase application.
• Enter the required document details.
• Select the required document type.
• Submit the information.
• The system processes the request through the backend.
• Gemini AI generates the legal document content.
• The generated content is displayed for review and editing.
• Download the document in the required format.

3. DEMONSTRATION OUTPUT

The system provides:

• Generated legal document
• Editable content
• HTML preview
• DOCX download
• PDF download
